                <pb facs="0603" n="507" xml:id="pg507"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">882.6176 F 51/195: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Chargé in Liberia</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                        >Wharton</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of State</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Monrovia</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1926-01-28T12:00:00-00:44"><hi rendition="#italic">January 28,
                                1926—noon</hi></date>.<lb/>[Received 5:56 p.m.]</dateline></opener>
                <p>4. Rubber agreements ratified by Legislature. Loan ratified with modifications
                    will be cabled.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Wharton</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
